                plate attached to the wood base.&nbsp;&nbsp; It measures
                11&quot; high.&nbsp; The piece is in good
                condition with some overall wear from age.&nbsp; THIS IS A VERY
                ATTRACTIVE WORK OF ART!!!&nbsp;&nbsp; Shipping and Insurance is
                $12.00&nbsp; (international shipments may be more and all
                international payments, including Canada, must be paid in U.S.
                dollars with international money order. Unless buyer assumes
                risk, insurance will be required on international shipments,
                including Canada). We will send within three business days upon
                receipt of money order or cashiers check. We ship in 10 days
                with personal check. You may use your Visa or MasterCard through
                <font color="blue">PayPal*</font>and we will ship within three
                business days. (more about PayPal below)*</b>
